    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Luxury rental within strolling distance to the Killarney National Park and just five minutes drive from Killarney town centre. Spacious, bright and warm and, despite being a large house, this property retains a cosy atmosphere.\r\n\r\nAlthough it is new and quite modern, the house has a country classic look which makes it very comfortable. There is under-floor heating throughout giving a constant temperature all year round. The large windows make the whole house very bright and allow guests to enjoy the wonderful garden and its private setting even from indoors.\r\n\r\nIn 2014 all 5 bedrooms were renovated - they were newly painted/papered and all have gorgeous new furniture and soft furnishings - each has a unique style and feel.\r\n\r\n\r\nLiving:\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall- spacious and welcoming with its beautiful curved staircase and gallery,\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room - open plan, with everything for the amateur chef including a 7 ring gas stove with three ovens and a large handmade dining table made from reclaimed wood, easily seating 8-10 people and looking out across the entire back garden.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - open to the kitchen, this is a large, high ceilinged room, with an L-shaped leather couch, LCD TV, DVD player and Wii and a beautiful gas stove to cosy up the evenings.\r\n\r\nSitting Room – elegant evening room with an HD projector and cinema screen for the home theatre.\r\n\r\nAll these rooms also have a built-in central music system.\r\nLaundry room – with washing machine, dryer and freezer.\r\nStudy- just off the kitchen/living area, with the bureau for you to work at on the computer provided. There is excellent WiFi coverage throughout the house as well as wired Ethernet in every room.\r\n\r\nBedrooms:\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom 1 - Super Kingsize Bed, high ceilings, TV and ensuite.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - Super Kingsize Bed, high ceilings\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2 single beds.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 -1 king bed + 1 small single bed\r\n\r\nDownstairs Bedroom 5 - King bed and TV.\r\n\r\nThe couch in the living room can fold out into a double bed if necessary and there is also a double Futon in the attic gallery/den.\r\n\r\nBaby cot, stair gate and highchair etc. available on request.\r\n\r\nBathrooms:\r\n\r\nMaster En-suite - with a separate walk-in shower and double spa bath.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom - with separate walk-in shower and steel bath.\r\n\r\nDownstairs Bathroom - with walk-in shower.\r\n\r\nGardens:\r\n\r\nA large, well-established garden surrounds the house with many beautiful birch and willow trees. There is a swing & slide set, a playhouse, a ‘fairy ring’ and a fire pit good for a bonfire as well as a big Australian style Barbeque on the sheltered Patio which also has loudspeakers and heaters over the table. The covered carport houses 2 adult and various children’s bicycles. Alongside the stone water feature and slate chippings, the many and varied plants and trees bring much colour to the garden throughout the year.\r\n\r\nThough quiet and rural, in an area of Ireland famed for the beauty of its mountains and lakes, the house is also close to all the amenities of the bustling town of Killarney.\r\n\r\nThe ideal retreat for families, golfers, hikers and bikers, cyclists, adventurers, fishermen, artists and of course anyone interested in history, culture and music."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Stunning 5 bedroom home from home\r\nKillarney National Park at your doorstep\r\nWithin a 5-minute drive of Killarney town centre\r\nWIFI, TV, HD Projector/Cinema Screen\r\nBuilt-in central music system in all rooms\r\nPets not allowed"
      }
